<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.scratch.lists ~ the live scratch sensoria

`lares sensorium ls` lists every live scratch sensorium and counts the orphans a dissolve `--orphans` would reap.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ ls

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`ls` params=`~ list the live sensoria`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[mode corpora orphans]] ~ the live sensoria and the orphan count`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

